# Reviewer selection for AGENTS.md rule 11: one independent reviewer session
# double-checks every agent-made commit and merge, including WIP checkpoints.
#
# Copy this file to config/reviewer.local (gitignored).
# Owner policy: the DeepSeek V4.1 Flash-Max reviewer only; no second model is
# required. The identity that matters is the model, not the provider — accept
# either `deepseek-v4.1-flash#max` or `deepseek v4.1-flash-1017#max`, with or
# without a provider prefix. Add a provider prefix locally only if the harness
# needs one to launch the reviewer. If the reviewer is unavailable, ask the
# owner before substituting. Never use Sol to review.
#
REVIEWER_AGENT=general
REVIEWER_MODEL=deepseek-v4.1-flash#max
